{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"evidence\":[{\"source\":\"《字源》, 李學勤主編, 2012, 天津古籍出版社 / 遼寧人民出版社, ISBN 9787552800692; attached source scan directly inspected\",\"field\":\"好 headword; formation and meaning discussion; printed p. 1094 / PDF p. 1109; exact bronze quotation occurrence\",\"text\":\"The scan confirms the 好 headword and printed page 1094 (PDF page 1109). The author analyzes early forms as 女 plus 子 and proposes ‘woman’ as the original meaning, then discusses extensions to beauty/goodness and ‘like/love’; these are the author’s historical interpretations, not direct attestation of the proposed original meaning. At the cited bronze example, the scan reads exactly “虘钟：‘用乐好宾。’” The producer correction is verified as raw OCR span [1438,1439), 虐→虘; the following character remains printed simplified 钟. The effective OCR therefore has the exact passage literal 虘钟. The earlier evidence assertion “虘鐘” is incorrect in its second character. This page-specific record reflects the correction already applied by the producer; no further corpus edit was made.\",\"record_character\":\"好\",\"kind\":\"book_scan_inspected_and_ocr_correction_verified\",\"url\":\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"title\":\"《字源》, 2012 edition — scan and bibliographic record\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"},{\"source\":\"CiNii Books, National Institute of Informatics\",\"field\":\"Bibliographic record for 字源\",\"text\":\"The catalog record identifies 字源 as edited by 李学勤, published by 天津古籍出版社 in December 2012, in three volumes, and lists ISBN 9787552800692. It notes the description is based on the second printing (July 2013) and that the cover/spine name both 天津古籍出版社 and 辽宁人民出版社.\",\"record_character\":\"好\",\"kind\":\"bibliographic_record\",\"url\":\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817\",\"title\":\"CiNii Books — 字源\",\"accessed_at\":\"2026-10-03\"}],\"search_audit\":[{\"query\":\"《字源》 李学勤 2012 ISBN 9787552800692\",\"urls\":[\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817\",\"https://books.google.com/books/about/%E5%AD%97%E6%BA%90.html?id=xqP9zAEACAAJ\",\"https://www.sanmin.com.tw/product/index/004029656\",\"https://ci.nii.ac.jp/ncid/BB13266817?l=ja\"],\"outcome\":\"Search returned catalog and bookseller listings. Opened the CiNii record and inspected its bibliographic details; the Google Books and other results were not opened. CiNii confirms editor, publisher, December 2012 publication, three volumes, ISBN, and printing note.\"}],\"gaps\":[]}"}}
